      "content": "that makes sense. i noticed you put cottagecore and reggaeton in a \"middle ground\" category. can you expand on that? specifically, why would reggaeton be considered less \"prestigious\" for a luxury brand than something like the quiet luxury aesthetic? i'm trying to understand if there's an inherent \"vibe\" or social standing difference that keeps reggaeton in that middle/lower tier for high-end stuff.",
